WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.567
-Well, the knives are out
in the GOP

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.434
as Republicans begin to bicker
with each other

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:06.734
and look for someone to blame

00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:09.334
after their party collapsed
in Tuesday's midterms

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.200
and Joe Biden had
the best midterm showing

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.767
of any sitting president
in 20 years.

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:14.534
Republicans and right-wing media

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:16.200
are blaming everything
from voting machines

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.934
to young people, to women
and, perhaps most shockingly,

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.801
they're really pissed
at Donald Trump.

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:22.901
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:27.300
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.601
You know,
going into these midterms,

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:30.934
I was never nervous.
I knew anything was possible.

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:32.534
I was bracing for the worst.

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:34.334
But one thing that made me
feel better

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.634
was knowing that we had
patriots out there,

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:39.234
making sure our elections
were running smoothly.

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:41.501
Patriots like MyPillow
CEO Mike Lindell,

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:43.133
[ Laughter ]
who announced,

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:44.634
before the election,
that his team

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:47.801
would be monitoring every race
across the country for fraud

00:00:47.801 --> 00:00:50.634
through his website,
which has, as you would expect,

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:51.734
a ridiculous name --

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:53.634
frankspeech.com.

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:55.200
-We're going to be watching
every race.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.701
We're going to have
the real-time crime desk going

00:00:57.701 --> 00:00:59.033
at frankspeech.com.

00:00:59.033 --> 00:01:01.601
[ Laughter ]
Everybody can watch me there

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:03.167
tomorrow night.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.667
We are tracking every race
by cyber.

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.868
I want all the bad guys
out there to know,

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.234
through the Edison Report,
we are watching

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:12.133
and we also have
another way to watch

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:14.300
what's going on with the
computers and the machines,

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.334
so, I'm putting them all
on notice, Steve.

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:18.267
They're all on notice.

00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:19.267
-Hear that, bad guys?

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:21.100
[ Laughter ]
You are on notice.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.567
Mike Lindell is tracking
every race by cyber.

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:27.701
[ Laughter ]
Why is all of his computer
lingo 30 years old?

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.834
[ As Lindell ]
We're tracking
the bad guys by cyber

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:32.901
and using AOL Instant Messenger
to find out
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.901 --> 00:01:35.934
their age/sex/location.

00:01:35.934 --> 00:01:37.000
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.901
Lindell always talks like
he's being forced

00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:42.000
to write a science fiction novel
at gunpoint.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.234
[ Laughter ]
[ As Lindell ]
But I, I don't know anything

00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:44.467
about science fiction.

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:46.367
"Well, then I guess this is
goodbye, Lindell."

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:48.267
[ As Lindell ]
There were robots and machines

00:01:48.267 --> 00:01:51.601
[ Laughter ]
who were using cyber
to be, uh, bad guys.

00:01:51.601 --> 00:01:53.000
[ Laughter ]
And mankind's only hope was

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.400
the Edison Project,
led by the fearless astronaut

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.400
Frank Speech.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:59.968
So, Lindell said he was tracking
every race through cyber.

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.200
He even said,
during a livestream

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.133
on election night,
when the host tried

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:05.167
to wrap things up,
that he would stay there

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:06.868
and keep tracking votes
all night.

00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:08.400
-I think Mike is back.
Mike, we were starting

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.467
to make up wrap-up comments
for the evening.

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:12.267
What do you think?

00:02:12.267 --> 00:02:14.000
-I didn't know we were
wrapping up comments.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.400
I got General Flynn coming on

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.200
and we got a video of Kari Lake
40 minutes ago.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.634
-[ Laughs ]
-I don't know if you guys --

00:02:19.634 --> 00:02:21.767
I'm staying up all night
'til we win!

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:23.300
-I don't think
it's great advertising

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.801
that a pillow salesman never
seems to want to go to bed.

00:02:25.801 --> 00:02:27.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:29.434
[ As Lindell ]
I'm pulling a back-to-back
all-nighter,

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:32.601
anything not to put my head
on that lumpy sack of wrenches.

00:02:32.601 --> 00:02:33.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:35.601
They smell like burnt rubber.

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:36.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:38.334
You won't be surprised
to hear that, on Tuesday,

00:02:38.334 --> 00:02:39.601
when it was clear the Democrats

00:02:39.601 --> 00:02:41.467
had vastly outperformed
expectations,

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:43.701
Republicans still had not taken
control of the House or Senate,

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:46.334
as expected,
Lindell let the world know

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:49.868
he had found the bad guys
who did all the fraud and stuff.

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:51.601
By the way,
see if you can follow any

00:02:51.601 --> 00:02:53.868
of this completely
incoherent word vomit.

00:02:53.868 --> 00:02:56.234
-I want to bring in
Mike Lindell.

00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:58.000
Mike, you got some
interesting results

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.567
you wanted to share.
Go ahead.

00:02:59.567 --> 00:03:00.934
-Yeah. Well, first of all,

00:03:00.934 --> 00:03:02.133
when you guys
were talking before,

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:03.400
I was listening to you.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.334
Who attacked our country
and what is this all about?

00:03:06.334 --> 00:03:10.400
It's the CCP, the UNA party,
the deep state, the globalists,

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.534
and, now, the Democrat Party
joining with all of them.

00:03:13.534 --> 00:03:15.267
Here's what we have.

00:03:15.267 --> 00:03:19.767
In our real-time crime desk,
if you have a graphic to put up,

00:03:19.767 --> 00:03:21.734
I'm going to show you
just one of them

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.801
and this is
Herschel Walker here.

00:03:23.801 --> 00:03:25.667
[ Laughter ]
So, we're watching these races.

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:28.067
Vance was one.
I believe, early on,

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:30.534
they were taking it,
taking Vance,

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:32.434
and I think they just didn't put
any injection

00:03:32.434 --> 00:03:34.734
because he totally overran
the algorithm.

00:03:34.734 --> 00:03:38.767
We're watching these races
and it's like real-time crime.

00:03:38.767 --> 00:03:40.367
I call it a crime spike.

00:03:40.367 --> 00:03:42.334
And then you get
these crime spikes.

00:03:42.334 --> 00:03:43.667
[ Laughter ]
-Jesus, dude. Mike Lindell's

00:03:43.667 --> 00:03:45.267
the only guy I can think of

00:03:45.267 --> 00:03:47.133
who would get cut off
at Starbucks.

00:03:47.133 --> 00:03:49.367
[ Laughter ]
"Sir, I think you've had

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:51.267
enough macchiatos.
Let me call you a cab."

00:03:51.267 --> 00:03:53.100
[ As Lindell ]
No, thanks. I'll just fly home.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:57.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.734
Real-time crime line.

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:01.734
He's like McGruff, if someone
put meth in his kibble.

00:04:01.734 --> 00:04:04.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.033 --> 00:04:05.567
Here's a pretty good way
to track how well

00:04:05.567 --> 00:04:07.434
the Democrats are doing --
the better the night they have,

00:04:07.434 --> 00:04:08.934
the more incoherent
Mike Lindell gets.

00:04:08.934 --> 00:04:11.801
In 2020, Lindell was like,
"There's fraud in the machines."

00:04:11.801 --> 00:04:13.334
Very simple.
Now, the Republicans

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:15.567
and, specifically, Trump,
have gotten crushed again,

00:04:15.567 --> 00:04:17.000
he's spitting out and vomiting

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.734
a bunch of meaningless nonsense
at lightning speed,

00:04:19.734 --> 00:04:22.334
like an Amazon Echo
that got dropped in the toilet.

00:04:22.334 --> 00:04:23.501
[ Laughter ]
Hey, Alexa,

00:04:23.501 --> 00:04:25.334
can you give me
an election update?

00:04:25.334 --> 00:04:28.467
-China CCP, UNA party,
global deep state, Dominion,

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:31.534
CIA voting machines hacked
are cybercrime spike

00:04:31.534 --> 00:04:34.000
through the real-time
cybercrime cyberdesk.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.701
Cyber, cyber, cyber, cyber,

00:04:35.701 --> 00:04:36.701
[ Laughter ]
cyber, cyber,

00:04:36.701 --> 00:04:38.734
-Okay, okay, okay.
Oh, and also,

00:04:38.734 --> 00:04:41.000
who did the Dolphins
beat this weekend?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.033
-Da Bears.

00:04:42.033 --> 00:04:44.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:47.367
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:04:47.367 --> 00:04:49.701
-So, Lindell is blaming...

00:04:49.701 --> 00:04:50.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.801 --> 00:04:52.767
...fraud, but many other
right-wing pundits

00:04:52.767 --> 00:04:55.000
are looking elsewhere
for suspects.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.834
On Fox News, for example,
they're blaming the fact

00:04:56.834 --> 00:04:59.667
that no one seems
to hate Joe Biden.

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:02.901
-There's just not the hatred
for Joe Biden

00:05:02.901 --> 00:05:05.601
that there is for Barack Obama
and for the Clintons.

00:05:05.601 --> 00:05:08.267
There's not a Hate Biden vote
that's out there.

00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:09.968
You know, when you go,
Trump's on the ballot,

00:05:09.968 --> 00:05:12.334
there's that Hate Trump
Democrat vote?

00:05:12.334 --> 00:05:15.968
People just don't feel the same
passion against the guy.

00:05:15.968 --> 00:05:18.267
-I love watching it dawn
on Fox News in real time

00:05:18.267 --> 00:05:19.400
that the stuff
they've been saying

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.234
for over two years is
total bull[bleep].

00:05:21.234 --> 00:05:23.767
[ Laughter ]
It's like watching someone's
face drop on "Love is Blind"

00:05:23.767 --> 00:05:24.968
when the reveal happens and...

00:05:24.968 --> 00:05:26.400
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.734
...they realize they're not

00:05:27.734 --> 00:05:30.534
into the person
they're engaged to.

00:05:30.534 --> 00:05:33.434
You dips spent two full years
talking about impeaching Biden

00:05:33.434 --> 00:05:34.701
and claiming
he was actually, somehow,

00:05:34.701 --> 00:05:37.267
the nefarious mastermind
behind a shadowy plot

00:05:37.267 --> 00:05:39.000
to flood the country
with street gangs,

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.234
make America Communist,

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:42.000
indoctrinate our children
with wokeism,

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.067
and turn the military into

00:05:43.067 --> 00:05:44.634
a gender studies class
at Bryn Mawr.

00:05:44.634 --> 00:05:45.434
Nobody bought it.

00:05:45.434 --> 00:05:46.934
Even the graphics you aired

00:05:46.934 --> 00:05:48.167
to make him look scary

00:05:48.167 --> 00:05:49.767
actually made him look cooler

00:05:49.767 --> 00:05:51.534
than he was, like this one.

00:05:51.534 --> 00:05:52.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:52.934 --> 00:05:55.067
They mocked up with Biden
eating ice cream

00:05:55.067 --> 00:05:56.167
in front of a burning building.

00:05:56.167 --> 00:05:57.601
That actually aired on Fox.

00:05:57.601 --> 00:05:58.667
Biden doesn't look evil.

00:05:58.667 --> 00:05:59.767
He looks like he just snarled,

00:05:59.767 --> 00:06:01.033
"Get off my plane,"

00:06:01.033 --> 00:06:03.067
before kicking Gary Oldman
off Air Force One.

00:06:03.067 --> 00:06:04.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:04.467 --> 00:06:06.701
You don't have to like Biden
to know he's not

00:06:06.701 --> 00:06:08.667
some Chairman Mao-type
revolutionary.

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:10.934
He's a 79-year-old man
from Scranton

00:06:10.934 --> 00:06:12.100
who takes the train to work

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.267
and, occasionally,
gets stuck onstage

00:06:14.267 --> 00:06:17.300
[ Laughter ]
or trips on the stairs

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:18.634
to Air Force One

00:06:18.634 --> 00:06:20.267
three times in a row!

00:06:20.267 --> 00:06:22.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:22.033 --> 00:06:24.834
Fox News viewers
might hate Democrats,

00:06:24.834 --> 00:06:27.534
but they are the age demographic
that, when they see Biden,

00:06:27.534 --> 00:06:28.567
they can't help but think,

00:06:28.567 --> 00:06:29.934
[ Gruffly ]
"Ah, he's one of us."

00:06:29.934 --> 00:06:31.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:31.234 --> 00:06:32.667
Fox News tries
to make him a villain

00:06:32.667 --> 00:06:34.667
when he'd make
a far better spokesperson

00:06:34.667 --> 00:06:36.100
in one of their commercials.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:38.167 --> 00:06:40.133
But the stair video
was actually a clue.

00:06:40.133 --> 00:06:41.434
That should've been a sign,
right there,

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:44.067
that Biden was better at this
than we all thought.

00:06:44.067 --> 00:06:46.100
Even when he falls, he falls up.

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:48.133
[ Laughter ]
You know, if Trump had tripped
on the stairs,

00:06:48.133 --> 00:06:50.367
he would've somehow rolled
all the way down to the Potomac,

00:06:50.367 --> 00:06:52.801
where they'd have to fish him
out using a pool scoop.

00:06:52.801 --> 00:06:54.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:54.701 --> 00:06:57.067
That was not the only reason,
according to Fox,

00:06:57.067 --> 00:06:58.400
for Biden's performance
last night.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.901
Apparently, it's also the fault

00:06:59.901 --> 00:07:03.501
of people who live in cities,
single women, and young voters.

00:07:03.501 --> 00:07:06.567
-Single women are voting
for Democrats by 30 points,

00:07:06.567 --> 00:07:08.100
-37.
-37 points!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.133
-Yeah.
-In urban America.

00:07:10.133 --> 00:07:12.334
They're cleaning our clocks
in the cities,

00:07:12.334 --> 00:07:13.701
cleaning our clocks!

00:07:13.701 --> 00:07:15.300
I'm not saying anything
nefarious is going on,

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.133
but they are cleaning our clocks
in the cities

00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:20.234
[ Laughter ]
and we're giving it away.

00:07:20.234 --> 00:07:24.000
And the fact that these youth
voters are coming in so strong

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.701
on an off-year
is very concerning.

00:07:26.701 --> 00:07:28.234
It looks like
they've been brainwashed.

00:07:28.234 --> 00:07:30.467
[ Laughter ]
This new generation
is totally brainwashed.

00:07:30.467 --> 00:07:34.033
-Yeah, all these 25-year-old
Gen Z TikTokers

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:35.267
have been totally brainwashed

00:07:35.267 --> 00:07:37.834
by 79-year-old

00:07:37.834 --> 00:07:40.767
[ Laughter and applause ]
Joe Biden?

00:07:40.767 --> 00:07:43.133
That's why the kids are all
doing the Joe Biden Challenge,

00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:45.000
where you try to eat
an entire ice cream cone

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.834
before the burning house
behind you melts it.

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:49.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:49.968 --> 00:07:53.133
The dumbest part came later,
when Watters pitched a solution

00:07:53.133 --> 00:07:55.100
to Republicans' problems
with single women --

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.834
just make the single women
get married.

00:07:57.834 --> 00:08:03.234
-Single women are breaking
for Democrats by 30 points!

00:08:03.234 --> 00:08:04.734
And this makes sense,
when you think

00:08:04.734 --> 00:08:06.801
about how Democrat policies
are designed

00:08:06.801 --> 00:08:08.467
to keep women single.
[ Pats desk ]

00:08:08.467 --> 00:08:10.434
[ Laughter ]
But once women get married,

00:08:10.434 --> 00:08:11.834
they vote Republican.

00:08:11.834 --> 00:08:13.267
Married women, married men,

00:08:13.267 --> 00:08:15.968
go for Republicans
by double digits.

00:08:15.968 --> 00:08:18.067
But single women,
and voters under 40

00:08:18.067 --> 00:08:20.701
have been captured by Democrats.

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:22.567
So, we need these ladies
to get married.

00:08:22.567 --> 00:08:24.567
[ Laughter and ohhs ]
And it's time to fall in love

00:08:24.567 --> 00:08:26.467
and just settle down.
Guys... [ Pats desk ]

00:08:26.467 --> 00:08:27.701
go put a ring on it.

00:08:27.701 --> 00:08:29.968
[ Laughter and ohhs ]
-I...doubt single women

00:08:29.968 --> 00:08:31.300
are going to take advice
from a guy

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.267
who looks like he'd walk up
to you at a bar and ask,

00:08:33.267 --> 00:08:34.901
"Did it hurt?"
But then forget

00:08:34.901 --> 00:08:36.033
"when you fell from heaven"

00:08:36.033 --> 00:08:38.534
and scramble
to finish the line, anyway.

00:08:38.534 --> 00:08:39.367
[ As Watters ]
Did it hurt?

00:08:39.367 --> 00:08:40.100
"Did what hurt?"

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:41.467
You know, when you fell.

00:08:41.467 --> 00:08:42.534
"Fell where?"

00:08:42.534 --> 00:08:44.267
Uh...

00:08:44.267 --> 00:08:45.534
up the stairs?

00:08:45.534 --> 00:08:46.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:46.968 --> 00:08:49.300
Also, dudes, let me give you
all a little advice.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:50.601
Just because you put
a ring on it,

00:08:50.601 --> 00:08:52.868
don't expect your spouse's
opinions on politics --

00:08:52.868 --> 00:08:54.868
or anything, for that matter --

00:08:54.868 --> 00:08:56.634
to more closely align
with yours.

00:08:56.634 --> 00:08:58.667
I've been married for nine years
and, mysteriously,

00:08:58.667 --> 00:09:00.701
my wife still can't seem to find

00:09:00.701 --> 00:09:02.834
any space in our apartment
for my artwork.

00:09:02.834 --> 00:09:05.300
Why do you think I still have
all this [bleep] on my desk?

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:06.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.801
Because I'm not allowed
to bring it home.

00:09:07.801 --> 00:09:10.467
We have a perfectly good
coffee table with nothing on it!

00:09:10.467 --> 00:09:12.534
[ Laughter ]
And yet, somehow there's no room

00:09:12.534 --> 00:09:15.334
for my Andy Samberg "My doink
fell off" mummy statue.

00:09:15.334 --> 00:09:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:18.200
Oh, but, yeah,
I'm going to convince her

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.667
to listen
to my political opinions.

00:09:19.667 --> 00:09:21.234
She doesn't even watch the show

00:09:21.234 --> 00:09:23.734
and, when I asked her why
she doesn't watch, she said,

00:09:23.734 --> 00:09:26.334
"Our TV doesn't get NBC."

00:09:26.334 --> 00:09:30.000
[ Laughter ]

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.267
That can't be right.

00:09:31.267 --> 00:09:34.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:35.534 --> 00:09:36.601
We have --

00:09:36.601 --> 00:09:37.734
We have Peacock.

00:09:37.734 --> 00:09:40.634
[ Laughter ]

00:09:40.634 --> 00:09:42.901
By the way, Fox News

00:09:42.901 --> 00:09:45.200
was not the only observer
of Tuesday's midterms

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.601
who seems to have drawn
the conclusion

00:09:46.601 --> 00:09:48.701
that voters just don't hate
Joe Biden that much.

00:09:48.701 --> 00:09:50.133
Biden himself seems
to have come away

00:09:50.133 --> 00:09:52.434
with some renewed confidence,
as he made clear

00:09:52.434 --> 00:09:54.734
in a press conference
at the White House yesterday,

00:09:54.734 --> 00:09:56.868
where he was asked how he would
change his presidency

00:09:56.868 --> 00:09:58.601
going forward,
based on the results,

00:09:58.601 --> 00:10:00.300
and gave a very succinct answer.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:03.234
-What, in the next two years,
do you intend to do differently

00:10:03.234 --> 00:10:06.400
to change people's opinion
of the direction of the country,

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.968
particularly, as you contemplate
a run for president in 2024?

00:10:09.968 --> 00:10:11.033
-Nothing.

00:10:11.033 --> 00:10:14.901
[ Laughter ]
-My dude is feeling it!

00:10:14.901 --> 00:10:17.133
I wouldn't have been shocked if,
right after he said that,

00:10:17.133 --> 00:10:18.801
Dr. Jill sped through
on a Harley

00:10:18.801 --> 00:10:20.234
and he just jumped on the back.

00:10:20.234 --> 00:10:22.234
[ Laughter ]

00:10:22.234 --> 00:10:24.067
Also, how great is it
to have short answers

00:10:24.067 --> 00:10:25.567
at a press conference
after four years

00:10:25.567 --> 00:10:27.234
of president Alphabet Soup
over here?

00:10:27.234 --> 00:10:30.000
[ Laughter ]
If you asked Trump
that same question, he'd say --

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.133
[ As Trump ]
What am I going to do to change?

00:10:31.133 --> 00:10:32.434
I'll tell you
who should change --

00:10:32.434 --> 00:10:34.133
the crooked Democrats
because what they're doing,

00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:37.234
they're ruining this country
with the crime and the windmills

00:10:37.234 --> 00:10:39.400
and the windmills
committing crime.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.868
[ Laughter ]
Some people are saying
the windmills are forming gangs

00:10:41.868 --> 00:10:43.934
in New York City, now,
subway gangs.

00:10:43.934 --> 00:10:45.400
[ Laughter ]
The windmills,
they go in the subway

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.200
and they pick your pocket
and it's easy for them

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.267
because, when you think
about it,

00:10:48.267 --> 00:10:49.634
they have three arms, you know?

00:10:49.634 --> 00:10:50.634
[ Laughter ]

00:10:50.634 --> 00:10:51.701
They wave at you with two

00:10:51.701 --> 00:10:53.234
and then the other one
grabs the wallet.

00:10:53.234 --> 00:10:55.534
[ Laughter ]
When you try to stop them,

00:10:55.534 --> 00:10:57.200
they just blow you back
with their wind.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.234
[ Laughter ]
So, when it comes to changes,
if I'm being honest --

00:11:00.234 --> 00:11:01.968
and I do want
to wrap up this answer --

00:11:01.968 --> 00:11:03.901
[ Laughter ]
when it comes to changes,

00:11:03.901 --> 00:11:05.767
I think the great David Bowie
said it back --

00:11:05.767 --> 00:11:07.367
"Turn and face the strange,

00:11:07.367 --> 00:11:09.067
ch-ch-ch-ch-changes.

00:11:09.067 --> 00:11:11.868
[ Laughter and applause ]
Don't want to be a richer man,"

00:11:11.868 --> 00:11:13.934
but of course I do,
I do want to be a richer man,

00:11:13.934 --> 00:11:17.934
So, on that point, David and I
will have to agree to disagree.

00:11:17.934 --> 00:11:21.634
[ Laughter and applause ]
So, right-wing pundits cycled
through every excuse

00:11:21.634 --> 00:11:23.501
they could think of
for their poor performance --

00:11:23.501 --> 00:11:25.901
voting machines, young people,
single women, cities --

00:11:25.901 --> 00:11:28.667
but, eventually, they did land
on one explanation

00:11:28.667 --> 00:11:32.000
that seems more in the ballpark
of reality -- Donald Trump.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.934
Trump's clown car of bozos
and doofuses

00:11:33.934 --> 00:11:35.100
got creamed on Tuesday.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.801
Pro-Trump weirdos running
for House and Senate

00:11:36.801 --> 00:11:39.067
got crushed,
especially compared

00:11:39.067 --> 00:11:40.934
to the more traditional
Republican candidates

00:11:40.934 --> 00:11:42.467
who've distanced themselves
from Trump.

00:11:42.467 --> 00:11:44.801
Even Lauren Boebert
is struggling to hang on

00:11:44.801 --> 00:11:46.067
in a safe Republican seat

00:11:46.067 --> 00:11:47.300
that no one thought
was competitive.

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:49.400
I'm not saying I was psyched

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.067
when I saw Boebert was
in a tight race,

00:11:51.067 --> 00:11:53.033
but when they flashed
those numbers on election night,

00:11:53.033 --> 00:11:54.267
I turned to my wife and said...

00:11:54.267 --> 00:11:56.400
-I'm staying up all night,
'til we win!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:58.234 --> 00:11:59.901
And then she said,

00:11:59.901 --> 00:12:02.834
"Take that mummy back
to the office!"

00:12:02.834 --> 00:12:03.767
[ Laughter ]

00:12:03.767 --> 00:12:06.000
It's a conversation piece!

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.601
[ Laughter ]

00:12:09.601 --> 00:12:12.434
And, sure enough, the knives
are now out for Trump,

00:12:12.434 --> 00:12:14.767
as the right-wing media
that fueled his rise to stardom,

00:12:14.767 --> 00:12:16.534
in the first place,
turns on him,

00:12:16.534 --> 00:12:19.334
including some of his longtime
fanboys at Fox News.

00:12:19.334 --> 00:12:21.267
-It looks like we're --
in all likelihood,

00:12:21.267 --> 00:12:23.501
we could be at the status quo,
a 50/50 Senate again.

00:12:23.501 --> 00:12:25.467
If that happens, Donald Trump
cost us the presiden--

00:12:25.467 --> 00:12:27.734
the Senate twice in a row.

00:12:27.734 --> 00:12:29.634
-Donald Trump's not going
to like this,

00:12:29.634 --> 00:12:32.067
but I got to tell you,
the people I talk to,

00:12:32.067 --> 00:12:34.067
they say, "We love Donald Trump.

00:12:34.067 --> 00:12:36.300
We're so grateful
that he beat Hillary Clinton.

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:37.868
We love his policies.

00:12:37.868 --> 00:12:40.033
We think it's unfair,
how the media's treated him.

00:12:40.033 --> 00:12:42.934
It's unfair, what the Department
of Justice has treated him.

00:12:42.934 --> 00:12:44.434
But you know what?

00:12:44.434 --> 00:12:46.100
We don't like all the drama.

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:48.000
We like Ron DeSantis."

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.534
That's what I hear.

00:12:49.534 --> 00:12:50.567
-Does Trump win?

00:12:50.567 --> 00:12:51.934
I hope so.
I love the guy.

00:12:51.934 --> 00:12:54.801
And, a week ago, I would've said
slam dunk. [ Pats desk ]

00:12:54.801 --> 00:12:58.200
But after how last night
shook out, I don't know now.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:01.501
Democrats will walk over hot
coals to vote against Trump.

00:13:01.501 --> 00:13:04.634
-So, going into 2024,
the Republicans are going

00:13:04.634 --> 00:13:08.868
to be looking for candidates
who are focused on winning,

00:13:08.868 --> 00:13:12.000
not just making a point
or settling a score.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:15.067
The populist movement is
about ideas.

00:13:15.067 --> 00:13:18.334
It is not about any one person.

00:13:18.334 --> 00:13:20.601
If the voters conclude
that you're putting

00:13:20.601 --> 00:13:23.133
your own ego
or your own grudges

00:13:23.133 --> 00:13:25.067
ahead of what's good
for the country,

00:13:25.067 --> 00:13:27.167
they're going to look
elsewhere, period.

00:13:32.033 --> 00:13:33.667
-Trump is the past.

00:13:33.667 --> 00:13:35.934
-Man, Republicans are running
away from Trump faster

00:13:35.934 --> 00:13:37.901
than Josh Hawley on January 6th.

00:13:37.901 --> 00:13:38.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:38.968 --> 00:13:40.667
These guys went
from devoting themselves

00:13:40.667 --> 00:13:42.000
to Trump for over six years

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.234
to suddenly
tossing him overboard

00:13:43.234 --> 00:13:44.267
in the span of 24 hours.

00:13:44.267 --> 00:13:45.567
I got to say, it's fun to watch.

00:13:45.567 --> 00:13:47.901
Fox News versus Trump is like
"Alien vs. Predator"

00:13:47.901 --> 00:13:49.234
or "Godzilla vs. Kong"

00:13:49.234 --> 00:13:50.767
or Biden versus stairs.

00:13:50.767 --> 00:13:52.234
[ Laughter ]
Well, guess what.

00:13:52.234 --> 00:13:54.100
He's not just going
to magically go away,

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.968
especially after you spent six
years slavishly supporting him.

00:13:56.968 --> 00:13:58.334
He's Donald Trump.
He's incapable

00:13:58.334 --> 00:14:00.200
of keeping his mouth shut
for longer than five seconds.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.968
Dude can't even stand still.

00:14:01.968 --> 00:14:04.200
Whenever he has to pose
for a photo op,

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.467
he does that thing
where he sways back and forth,

00:14:06.467 --> 00:14:08.734
[ Laughter ]
like a drunk guy
on a cruise ship

00:14:08.734 --> 00:14:09.801
that's caught in a storm.

00:14:09.801 --> 00:14:11.734
[ Laughter ]
The GOP might

00:14:11.734 --> 00:14:13.467
suddenly want
to cut ties with Trump,

00:14:13.467 --> 00:14:15.634
but for Republicans,
Donald Trump is like Jason --

00:14:15.634 --> 00:14:17.267
nothing you can do stops him.

00:14:17.267 --> 00:14:18.334
Plus, you know,
he always looks like

00:14:18.334 --> 00:14:20.634
he just drowned in a lake
at a summer camp.

00:14:20.634 --> 00:14:23.033
[ Laughter ]
You guys created this monster

00:14:23.033 --> 00:14:24.267
and, now, you're going
to have to live with them.

00:14:24.267 --> 00:14:26.567
You don't just get
to wave it all away

00:14:26.567 --> 00:14:27.801
and say stuff like this --

00:14:27.801 --> 00:14:29.367
-Trump is the past.

00:14:29.367 --> 00:14:31.901
-You wish he was!
It's too late, mother[bleep]!

00:14:31.901 --> 00:14:33.734
[ Laughter and applause ]
You doinks could've helped

00:14:33.734 --> 00:14:35.801
impeach and convict him
and you probably would've been

00:14:35.801 --> 00:14:37.834
riding high
on a red tsunami Tuesday,

00:14:37.834 --> 00:14:39.400
but, instead,
you had to kiss the ring.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.767
House GOP Leader Kevin McCarthy,

00:14:40.767 --> 00:14:41.934
who hopes to be
the next speaker,

00:14:41.934 --> 00:14:43.701
if Republicans eke out
a majority in the House,

00:14:43.701 --> 00:14:46.801
even flew down to Mar-A-Lago
for that photo op,

00:14:46.801 --> 00:14:48.968
like two real estate agents
who are trying to sell you

00:14:48.968 --> 00:14:51.934
a house on haunted
burial ground.
[ Laughter ]

00:14:51.934 --> 00:14:54.634
[ As Trump ]
You have the ghosts
and the ghouls.

00:14:54.634 --> 00:14:56.033
We love the ghouls.
[ Laughter ]

00:14:56.033 --> 00:14:58.100
And the ghouls,
they'll wail all night

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.400
and rattle their chains,
but look at the high ceilings

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.501
and, you know, it's close
to good schools and shopping.

00:15:02.501 --> 00:15:04.267
[ Laughter ]

00:15:04.267 --> 00:15:06.334
Voters, once again,
repudiated the MAGA movement

00:15:06.334 --> 00:15:07.434
and Trumpism on Tuesday,

00:15:07.434 --> 00:15:09.934
just as they did
in 2018 and 2020,

00:15:09.934 --> 00:15:11.601
and now, suddenly,
the same Republicans

00:15:11.601 --> 00:15:14.000
who marched in lockstep
behind Trump for six years,

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.567
wreaking havoc on the nation,

00:15:15.567 --> 00:15:18.467
want to cut ties and run away
from him as fast as they can.

00:15:18.467 --> 00:15:20.934
The Trumpified GOP has alienated
everyone from women

00:15:20.934 --> 00:15:22.634
to suburban voters,
to people in cities;

00:15:22.634 --> 00:15:24.968
to young voters, who are
especially hard to poll

00:15:24.968 --> 00:15:26.934
because they don't answer
phone calls.

00:15:26.934 --> 00:15:28.167
They prefer to communicate...

00:15:28.167 --> 00:15:29.033
-By cyber.

00:15:29.033 --> 00:15:29.868
-This has been...

00:15:29.868 --> 00:15:32.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:15:32.501 --> 00:15:33.734
..."A Closer Look."

00:15:33.734 --> 00:15:37.467
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

